---
import HomeLayout from '../layouts/HomeLayout.astro';
---

<HomeLayout title="Supul Amarakoon - Product Designer & Developer">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="min-h-[85vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 w-full">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 leading-tight">
            Hi, I'm Supul.
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Hired as a Product Designer, learned to be a Product Manager, working as a Product Delivery Manager.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Master of Digital Product Management, 25 Queens University
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
            Professional Webtoon Artist in my free time.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <a href="#contact" class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#50A684] text-white rounded-full hover:bg-[#3D8268] transition-colors font-medium">
            Let's connect
          </a>
            <a href="/resume.pdf" class="px-6 py-3 border-2 border-gray-300 text-gray-700 rounded-full hover:border-gray-400 transition-colors font-medium">
              Download my Resume
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <img src="/character.png" alt="Supul's character illustration" class="w-full max-w-lg" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- My Story Section -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-6 text-gray-900">
        My Story
      </h2>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
        I've faced this again and again. I begin in a product or design role, but end up wearing many hats.
      </p>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Card 1: Halostt -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="rounded-lg mb-6 min-h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/hats-collection.png" alt="Story illustration 1" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
              At <strong>Halostt</strong>, I was hired as a UX Designer, but became a Frontend Developer and a Design Manager.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Wittaya Aqua -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="rounded-lg mb-6 min-h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/more-hats.png" alt="Story illustration 2" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
              At <strong>Wittaya Aqua</strong>, I was Hired as a UX Designer, but ended up a Frontend Developer and a Content Creator.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Scotiabank -->
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="rounded-lg mb-6 min-h-[280px] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/even-more-hats.png" alt="Story illustration 3" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
              At <strong>Scotiabank</strong>, I was Hired as a Product Designer, ended up as Technical BA and a Release Manager.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mt-12 italic">
        If I join your company, what hats will I wear?<br />
        Whatever they are, I'll wear them in style.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- My Work Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-20 text-gray-900">
        My Work
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Project 1: Solar Offset App -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/mobile-app.png" alt="Solar Offset App" class="w-full" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Solar Offset App</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
              A full end-to-end product case study showcasing my methodology, decision-making, and mobile B2C design and dark-mode expertise UI.
            </p>
            <a href="/solar-offset" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-[#50A684] text-white rounded-full hover:bg-[#3D8268] transition-colors font-medium">
              See More
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2: ETF Dashboard -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/dashboard.png" alt="ETF Dashboard" class="w-full" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">ETF Dashboard</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
              A data-heavy B2B dashboard designed for clarity in complex workflows, highlighting my strengths in information design and dark-mode enterprise UI.
            </p>
            <a href="/etf-dashboard" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-[#50A684] text-white rounded-full hover:bg-[#3D8268] transition-colors font-medium">
              See More
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 3: Scotiabank Projects -->
        <div>
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center">
            <img src="/enterprise.png" alt="Scotiabank Projects" class="w-full" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Scotiabank Projects</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
              High-impact enterprise tools designed for large-scale financial operations: work I can discuss but not display.
            </p>
            <a href="/scotiabank" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-[#50A684] text-white rounded-full hover:bg-[#3D8268] transition-colors font-medium">
              See More
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What I Bring Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-20 text-gray-900">
        What I bring, and what I expect
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <img src="/character-2.png" alt="Supul's character" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-lg">
          <p>
            I bring a blend of UX, interaction, and design systems backed by enough technical know-how to keep everything realistic. I'm comfortable picking up new roles when the situation calls for it.
          </p>
          <p class="font-medium">
            PS: I'm particularly good in chaotic environments. Release management has trained me well.
          </p>
          <p>
            I expect a culture that values growth and invests in its people. I thrive in nurturing environments where expanding skills, trying new things, and learning openly are part of the process.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#4A9A7A] via-[#50A684] to-[#5BB28E] text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
        Curious to connect?
      </h2>
      <a href="#contact" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-white text-[#50A684] rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors font-medium text-lg">
        Let's get in touch :)
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</HomeLayout>
